  <categoryEntries>
    <categoryEntry name="Drones" id="00fc-c619-b9f6-09cd" hidden="false">
      <description>‘Drone’ models (Shield Drones, Missile Drones, Gun Drones, Marker Drones, etc), do not count as models while selecting a model to suffer a wound or while selecting models for Suppressed. After the last non-drone model in a unit dies, each drone model in that unit dies.</description>
    </categoryEntry>
  </categoryEntries>
