          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After you Activate an XV8 CRISIS BATTLESUITS unit in reserves, you may Deploy that unit wholly within 6+D6&quot; of this unit outside of engagement range of enemy units. If you do, during this turn&apos;s Move step, do not make a Move Roll and that unit cannot Advance or Reposition.</characteristic>
