        </profile>
        <profile name="Pulse Accelerator" id="33d6-20e8-1373-4164" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">While there are one or more PULSE ACCELERATOR DRONE models in this unit, you may select targets for&apos;Recon Pulse Carbine&apos; and&apos;Recon Drone Burst Cannon&apos; weapons in this unit an additional 8&quot; away.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Recon Sweep" id="276f-4098-0352-8f74" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">While there are one or more RECON DRONE models in this unit, while selecting the targets for your SUPPORT TURRETS unit&apos;s weapons or a Seeker Missile weapon for any of your units, you may instead target an enemy unit within 24&quot; of and visible to this unit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Stealth Fields" id="0d65-d46e-8763-6d3a" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">For each ranged attack that targets this unit, the Hit Roll of that attack is worsened by 1. Each RECON DRONE is equipped with: HUNTER PATHFINDERS (5) &amp; GRAV-INHIBITOR DRONE (1) - 70 points - Infantry Markerlights, Forward Deploy</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Long Range Patrol" id="6b1e-0af5-c834-a8e1" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After this unit&apos;s End step, if this turn was your first turn in a row, take another turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Grav-Inhibition Field" id="6e73-bd61-1f34-9ded" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">While there are one or more GRAV-INHIBITOR DRONE models in this unit, after any enemy unit&apos;s Move step, as a reaction, if that enemy unit is within engagement range of this unit, you may roll a D6. On a 4+, this unit may Reposition.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Stealth Fields" id="4ff1-caa3-8e7f-896d" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">For each ranged attack that targets this unit, the Hit Roll of that attack is worsened by 1. For each of up to 3 HUNTER PATHFINDERS models, that model may replace their Hunter Pulse</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
